cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: Single-cell Cell Typing (sc-annotate)
abstract: Cell types for single-cell and single-nucleus RNA-seq. Transfers labels from a labelled
  reference (CellTypist, or scANVI with scArches query mapping) or types clusters from marker gene
  sets (a user markers.csv or built-in human dorsal root ganglion, human knee joint and broad sets
  from published atlases), and writes a reusable reference model.
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
