  affiliation: University of Pennsylvania
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/sc-annotate
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
- single-cell
- single-nucleus
- transcriptomics
- genomics
- cell-typing
- label-transfer
- reference-mapping
- neuroscience
- pain
- musculoskeletal
